-- REVIEW ONLY: computable dated CMS/navbar invoker requirements supplement.
-- NOT AUTHORIZED, NOT PostgreSQL parsed, not an approved installation manifest.
-- D1e-minimum-grant-manifest.json contains source hashes and statements, defaults,
-- identity/sequences, trigger bodies, helper and current RLS dependencies.
-- Full-row SELECT is required only by actual r.* / to_jsonb(r) expressions.
-- Writes are per-column; no definer conversion, broad UPDATE or all-sequence grant.
-- Identity generation: no speculative independent sequence grants. Serial USAGE
-- appears only when the actual INSERT omits that sequence-backed default column.
-- Current owner/ACL/RLS/trigger/default/role agreement and shared impact review
-- REQUIRED. Existing PUBLIC/restrictive helper behavior is not bypassed here.
-- Freeze intersection/delta with D1c rights before approval: these requirements
-- must not double-own prior grants. Inverse ONLY for every absent-before applied
-- right and no later drift. Otherwise reconstruct exact captured ACL/grantor.
\set ON_ERROR_STOP on
BEGIN;
DO $guard$ BEGIN
 IF current_setting('d1e.cms_manifest_review',true) IS DISTINCT FROM 'APPROVED_EXACT_CURRENT_DELTA_AND_RLS'
 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Review-only: missing current exact delta and authorization'; END IF;
END $guard$;
